--- USW_100_TS3_TS5 (US_inter_beta) ---

Umbrella-sampling window set for the beta isomer's TS3<->TS5 interconversion (see ../README).
Restrains 'cobh' at 100 evenly spaced values (kappa=300) while pinning 'dD' at 0 (kappa=400),
seeded from ../../SMD_inter_beta/TS3_TS5/. rep1 window 023 had a corrupt seed structure
(reseeded from window 022, original kept as '.corrupt_bak'). WHAM output now parses without
NaNs in all three replicas -- an earlier WHAM-column-reading bug specific to this edge (the
CV file here has an extra 'dD' column ahead of 'cobh') appears to have been fixed since.

Note: this README documents pre-existing content; no existing file was modified.
